{"articleNo":"417958","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=417958&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] ★KIT Engineering Fair 2022 참가팀 시제품 운반(12월 7일) 시간표 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.11.25","hit":"5853","attachments":[{"name":"KIT Engineering Fair 2022 시제품 운반 시간표(홈페이지 공지).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=417958&attachNo=118880"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">KIT Engineering Fair 2022 참가팀 시제품 운반(12월 7일) 시간표 안내</span><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-size: 32px;\"><br></span></font><div style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">KIT </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">Engineering Fair 2022 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">참가팀의 시제품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">완성 작품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">운반 지원 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">수요조사 결과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">아래와 같이 운반을 지원하고자 하오니&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><b>해당 팀은 버스 및 트럭 탑승 시간을 준수하여&nbsp;</b></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">시제품을 운반 할 수 있도록 출발시간 20분 전에 도착 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></b></div><div style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 2;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">대 상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">버스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">트럭 운반 신청한 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">운반 일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 12</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">분</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">의 팀별 출발시간 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">탑승 대기 장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">공동실험실습관 정문 앞</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">주의 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.2pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -31.2pt; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">　　</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">트럭으로 운반 할 시제품은 운반 과정에서 파손 가능성이 있으니 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">반드시 박스 또는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">완충제 등으로 포장</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">해서&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.2pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -31.2pt; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 가져와야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-indent: -31.2pt;\">파손 시 책임지지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 30.8pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -30.8pt; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">　　</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">2)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">시제품 크기 초과 등 현장 상황에 따라 운반 시간이 지연 될 수 있으며 당초 신청한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">버스 탑승 인원을 초과하는 인원은&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 30.8pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -30.8pt; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 탑승이 불가함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -31pt; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">　　</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, 3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">분은 출발 시간이며 시제품 상차 및 탑승에 소요되는 시간을 고려하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">출발시간보다 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">분 일찍 도착해야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"27552\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n